# Setting Your Name in Zoom

@body

![Slide image 12](assets/lect03a-2026_announcements/image_012.png)

- Use your proper first name or a consistent nickname.
- Discussion marks are assigned by sorting names alphabetically by first name.
- Do not ??\:
  - Start with your last name (e.g., "Smith Jane").
  - Use something obscure (e.g., "iPhone User").
  - Use a different name each time (consistency is key).

- How to Change Your Name\:
  - Click on the "Participants" button at the bottom of the meeting window.
  - Hover over your name in the participant list and click "More."
  - Select "Rename."
  - Enter your new name and click "OK."

![Slide image 13](assets/lect03a-2026_announcements/image_013.png)

=== layout: two-panels
hidden: true
# Change Name Before a Meeting

@left

- Open the Zoom desktop client or the mobile app.
- Go to your profile by clicking on your profile picture or initials in the top-right corner.
- Select "Profile" from the dropdown menu.
- Click "Edit" next to your name.
- Enter your preferred name and then click "Save."

@right

![Slide image 14](assets/lect03a-2026_announcements/image_014.png)

